 "text": "Hi, how are you today? Keep the freezer and the fridge as close to their lowest setting as your fridge will go. Freeze the meat and sandwich fillings, keep the bread and drinks in the fridge. Put the cooler in a shaded spot and add an extra cold pack if it gets warm. Pack the cooler tightly, so there are no gaps for heat to build up. Use a cool mat under the tray to stop the bottom getting soggy. Tell him it' your weekend project to keep the family fed, and he's in charge of the barbecue. Yes, as soon as the weekend is over. Pour it out and fill the hose while the plastic is still soft, so it resets.",
